{"createdAt":"2026-10-01T03:25:32.985Z","data":{"body":[{"_key":"p1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"What is the GitHub Student Pack?"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h1"},{"_key":"p3","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The GitHub Student Pack is the name of a package in which GitHub offers students paid software, free server credits, GitHub Pro plans, and other benefits at no cost."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p5","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p4","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"In Japan, you can use it simply by registering a photo of your student ID or a school-issued email address. I don't know the total value, but there are so many benefits that you can't use them all, so anyone who uses GitHub should definitely sign up. Not signing up is basically a loss."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"date_precision":"day","description":"","emoji":"⚒️","hidden_from_listing":false,"is_work_in_progress":true,"properties":{},"published_updated_at":"2025-10-05T00:00:00.000Z","title":"GitHub Student Pack","translation":{"automatic":true,"sourceId":"01M3TQXSY203YPHCFP9Z11MYWP"}},"id":"01M3TQXWXSCN8WX5DJ0ZHHBYS8","locale":"en","publishedAt":"2025-10-05T00:00:00.000Z","seo":{"canonical":null,"description":null,"image":null,"noIndex":false,"title":null},"slug":"github-student-pack","terms":{"category":[{"id":"01M40J9EZG7N7XMZG3TAFYBE98","label":"Miscellaneous","locale":"en","name":"category","parentId":null,"slug":"misc","translationGroup":"01M40J9EZG7N7XMZG3TAFYBE98"}],"tag":[{"id":"01M40J9P9QVX3HS9J0D0SDRD90","label":"coding","locale":"en","name":"tag","parentId":null,"slug":"coding","translationGroup":"01M40J9P9QVX3HS9J0D0SDRD90"},{"id":"01M40J9Q9ZTBA6GQGRV3E9D2YK","label":"dev","locale":"en","name":"tag","parentId":null,"slug":"dev","translationGroup":"01M40J9Q9ZTBA6GQGRV3E9D2YK"},{"id":"01M40J9Y713CQ7RETX92T6DX37","label":"team-dev","locale":"en","name":"tag","parentId":null,